    "detailed_description": "Enfilade is a fast paced low poly multiplayer fps game with 30 levels and 18 weapons.<br>If there are not enough players there is bot support.<br>Level up and unlock new weapons.<br><br><strong><u>Game modes:</u></strong><br><br>There are 4 game modes -- Free For All, Team Death Match,  Domination, Gun Game<br><br><strong><u>Map voting:</u></strong><br><br>Players can vote for a map, the map with the most votes will be selected.<br><br><strong><u>List of weapons:</u></strong><br><br>3 Snipers -- M40A1, M107, SVD<br><br>3 Assault Rifles -- AK47, M4A1, Scar<br><br>5 SMGs -- Vector, Agram 2000, UZI, P90, MP5<br><br>2 Launchers --RPG-7, 40LMTS<br><br>1 Shotgun - M3<br><br>4 Pistols -- 1911, M9, 1911, P250<br><br><strong><u>Options:</u></strong><br><br>There are many options -- Aim toggle, Sound, Fov and more<br><br><strong><u>Gun customization</u></strong><br><br>There are 9 weapon skins and 6 attachments.",
